�Kamnten, Niou Tzersei, 1980. Eremomena spitia, kleistes biomekhanies, phtokhes sunoikies. Enas ephebos, o Pet, exaphanizetai, kai e mana tou e Louisa pethainei to epomeno proi apo stenakhoria. E aderphe tou, e dodekakhrone Mini, orphane apo goneis, eisballei athela tes ste zoe tes summathetrias tes Letos kai anatrepei tis bebaiotetes tes oikogeneias tes. Anoigei rogmes pou duskola tha kleisoun* ekhoun tis rizes tous sto parelthon, sto amerikaniko oneiro, se deuteres kai trites genies metanaston, sten parakme kai te phthora tes poles, se khamenes eukairies kai se epiloges pou lathepsan. Ki oso o thetos pateras tes Letos, o Mpeizel Kampanes, psakhnei na brei ti strabose ste diadrome, toso anametrietai me ta phantasmata kai tous phobous tes paidikes tou elikias* ki oso e gunaika tou e Souzan apomakrunetai apo konta tou ki apo ten koine ki anempneuste zoe tous, toso e Mini kai e Leto moiazoun na enelikionontai se enan kosmo sklera ki adika kamomeno. O khronos, san tis niphades tou khioniou, tous xegela, xeglistra kai khanetai. Mazi tou ki autoi."�
�Storgikos suzugos e adistaktos dolophonos; Mono ekeine xerei...
E zoe tous etan sunethismene, apoluta phusiologike. Ospou o antras tes egine protoselido. Gia kapoious etan ena teras, o drastes enos stugerou egklematos pou den timoretheke pote. Gia allous, enas athoos pou kategoretheke adika. Gia ten Tzin, etan o antras tes.
Alla tora einai nekros, kai e Tzin mporei epitelous na pei ta mustika tes. Giati panta uparkhoun mustika s' enan gamo -ston diko tous etan aplos ligo perissotera...
Kai einai polloi autoi pou theloun n' akousoun ten istoria tes. E astunomia, e reporter pou tes khtupaei ten porta... Kai e Tzin thelei na pei ten aletheia. Alla, an ekhei mathei kati ola auta ta khronia, einai pos e aletheia einai san to zumari -plathetai. Oi anthropoi pisteuoun panta auto pou esu theleis na pistepsoun;..."�
�Stis agries thalasses tes katekhomenes Elladas uparkhei ena mustiko eleutherias pou to gnorizoun mono oi gennaioi. E <>, to kaIki tes diaphuges, de metapherei anthropous[?] metapherei ten elpida tes ethnikes xasterias sten pio skoteine stigme tes sugkhrones Istorias. Kataktetes kai patriotes, dioktes kai kunegemenoi, oloi tous strateumenoi s' enan polemo pou tha krinei to mellon tou kosmou. Apo ton asumbibasto kapetan Miltiade Khouma mekhri ten karterike Elene tou, mikroi kai megaloi eroes strobilizontai s' ena epos pou ektulissetai sten panarkhaia thalassa tou Omerou. Ti apemeine apo aute te phobere antara; Mnemes kai boes mesa ston khrono alla kai e zoe auton ton anthropon, plousia se idanika, se oneira, se erotes kai pathe. Zoe moirasmene se epeisodia pou tha adunatouse na sullabei kai e pio tolmere phantasia.
Mia muthistorematike marturia gia tote pou oi psukhes etan phtiagmenes apo akribo metallo[?] tote pou ten Istoria ten egraphan oi aploi anthropoi."�
�Stis 3 tou Dekembre tou 1976 duo autokineta stamatoun exo apo to spiti tou Mpomp Marlei, sto Kingkston tes Tzamaikas. Bgainoun apo mesa epta tupoi me opla -e mepos okhto;-, ormoun sto spiti tou tragoudiste kai me 56 purobolismous epikheiroun na ton dolophonesoun, alla den ta kataphernoun.
Oi drastes paremeinan agnostoi kai asulleptoi.
Me epikentro auto to gegonos o Marlon Tzeims graphei mia istoria pou oute suntome einai oute mono epta phonous aphora. Sten istoria emplekontai praktores mustikon uperesion, gkangkster, emporoi narkotikon, politikoi, ektelestes, enas demosiographos, mia perierge nosokoma kai to phantasma enos dolophonemenou pou xerei polla... Kai mousike, polle mousike - kai pos allios, aphou briskomaste sten Tzamaika tes regke, tou rokstenti, tou ska;
O suggrapheas graphei gia ola auta, kai gia alla pou den legontai, me aristotekhniko tropo kai mas paradidei ena aristourgema pou pere to brabeio Man Booker 2015.
E suntome istoria epta phonon einai, kata te New York Times, san rimeik tou The Harder They Come, se skenothesia tou Tarantino, alla me saountrak tou Mpomp Marlei kai senario tou Oliber Stooun kai tou Ouiliam Phokner... Ena aristourgema
Ekhei diakrithei me:
* Brabeio Man Booker 2015
* Brabeio Muthistorematos Minnesota 2015
* Brabeio Muthistorematos Anisfield-Wolf 2015
* Brabeio Muthistorematos OCM Bocas tes Logotekhnias tes Karaibikes 2015
* Brabeio Green Carnation (2015)
* Brabeio American Book (2015)
* Brakheia Lista gia to Diethnes Logotekhniko Brabeio IMPAC Dublin (2015)
* Phinalist sto National Book Critics Circle (2014)
* Sta 10 kalutera tou 2014 gia tous New York Times
* Sta kalutera: Chicago Tribune, The Washington Post, Boston Globe, Time, Newsweek, Publishers Weekly, Library Journal"�
�... 1e Ianouariou 2014. E Ellada ekhei gurisei ste drakhme.
Einai mia Ellada tes phtokheias, ton astegon kai tes anastoles pleromon. O astunomos Kharitos kai e oikogeneia tou anagkazontai na kanoun aimateres oikonomies, opos oi perissoteroi Ellenes.
Kai eno oi Athenaioi ekhoun epidothei se agona epibioses, kapoios arkhizei na skotonei eponuma prosopa apo te genia tou Polutekhneiou. Pano se kathe thuma tou aphenei kai ena menuma pou parapempei sten exegerse tou Polutekhneiou. Poios einai o dolophonos; Kapoia akrodexia organose e kapoios pou ekdikeitai palies amarties;
E Athena psukhorragei, alla uparkhoun ki ekeinoi pou den theloun na ten aphesoun na pethanei.
Mia omada neon organonontai kai kanoun o,ti pernaei apo to kheri tous gia na kratesoun zontane ten pole sto pio adunato tes semeio.
Kai o astunomos Kharitos kunegaei enan dolophono phantasma, pou diarkos tou xepheugei.
To "Psomi, paideia, eleutheria" einai to trito muthistorema tes "Trilogias tes Kriseos" tou Petrou Markare."�
�Stis 14 Iouniou tou 2007, o Basilias kai o Prothupourgos tes Souedias exaphanistekan apo mia dexiose sto palati. Argotera eipotheke oti eikhan arrostesei[?] e aletheia einai diaphoretike. E pragmatike istoria arkhizei kamposa khronia prin, to 1961, me te gennese tes Nompeko Magieki se mia kaluba, sto Sobeto tes Notias Aphrikes. E Nompeko xephuge apo te sunethismene moira ton gunaikon tes periokhes tes, e opoia einai na megalonoun gregora kai na pethainoun noris. Te khtupese enas methusmenos odegos, mekhanikos sto epaggelma, kai e zoe tes pere diaphoretike trope. Kategoretheke gia to atukhema kai anagkasteke na doulepsei gia ton mekhaniko, pou etan epikephales enos programmatos zotikes semasias gia ten ethnike asphaleia tes khoras. H Nompeko etan kale sto noikokurio, alla akome kalutere -mia mikre idiophuIa- stous arithmous. O mekhanikos, pali, den etan[?] kai ekane ena terastio lathos. Tora mono e Nompeko to gnorizei...
Grammene me to spirtoziko kai panexupno khioumor tou Giounas Giounason, aute einai mia istoria gia to pos e prospatheia mias gunaikas na allaxei to diko tes mellon katelexe na allaxei ta panta."�	
�	E exairetika kalogrammene sulloge diegematon tou Anthony Marra, skiagraphei mia pleiada axekhaston kharakteron ton opoion oi zoes diastauronontai metaxu tous me tropo sparakhtiko.
Ten dekaetia tou 1930 sto Leningkrant, enas zographos-logokrites epexergazetai epimakhes photographies gia logariasmo tou Kommatos tou Stalin, sbenontas kai alloionontas prosopa me ton aerographo tou. Magemenos apo ten eikona mias mpalarinas, brisketai kategoroumenos gia skhese me ten polonike kataskopeia. Mia omada gunaikon aphegeitai tis istories tous, alla kai autes ton giagiadon tous, proen kratoumenon ton Gkoulagk, pou protes apoikesan ten Siberike pole nikelorukheion tous. Duo zeuge aderphon moirazontai mia agria, prostateutike agape. Nearoi andres se oloklere te proen Sobietike Enose antimetopizoun te bia sto spiti kai sto stratopedo. Kai megales thusies ginontai sto onoma tou pinaka enos topiou adiaphorou, ektos apo to skhedon akatanoeta eireniko parelthon pou apeikonizei.
O Tsaros tes agapes kai tes tekno, me ekplektike proza mila gia te mataioteta tes prospatheias na exaleiphthoun anthropoi kai gegonota, gia ten anthropine prosarmostikoteta, to paralogo tes zoes kai tou polemou, alla kai to poso mikre einai e zoe mas se skhese me to megethos tou sumpantos."�
�Argentine, 1950
O Mperni Gkounter phtanei sto Mpouenos Aires kai empleketai sto kunegi enos egklematia. Mia ephebe bretheke dolophonemene kai oi sunthekes thumizoun entona ekeines tes teleutaias upotheses pou eikhe analabei o Mperni os epitheoretes tou Tmematos Anthropoktonion sto Berolino. Mias upotheses pou den eikhe katapherei na dialeukanei. O arkhegos tes topikes astunomias pisteuei oti o drastes einai kapoios apo tous ekatontades proen Nazi pou ekhoun kataphugei sten Argentine meta to 1945. Poios katalleloteros apo ton Mperni Gkounter gia na brei ton dolophono!
Ena sunarpastiko muthistorema pou thetei prokletika erotemata: Poioi edosan kataphugio stous Nazi kai poso diadedomenos etan sten Argentine o antisemitismos sta khronia ton Peron;"�
