Apo to kodikopoieueno uenuua tou Proedrou tes Deuokratias Moustapha Keual ston astunouiko dieuthunte tes Istanupoul, Ekreu upee: <>.
Briskouaste sto uelagkholiko phthinoporo tou 1926. E Othouanike Autokratoria ekhei katarreusei eno e neare Deuokratia prospathei na orthopodesei. Enas antras brisketai sto kentro oles autes tes anatarakhes. O Sekhsoubar Saui... O anthropos pou briskotan stis protes grauues tes Enoses kai Proodou, o kourasuenos pleon kouitatzes. Mia aneleete uekhanorraphia phainetai na exuphainetai guro tou, eno panta to idio eroteua katatrogei to uualo tou: To kratos einai iero e o anthropos; <>."	��Q�@"	)\���(@"	ffffff@"	q=
